          "status": "ok",
          "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kax168/awesome-free-ai-apis/main/README.md",
          "result": "# Awesome Free AI APIs 🤖✨\n\n[![Awesome](https://awesome.re/badge.svg)](https://awesome.re)\n[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](LICENSE)\n[![PRs Welcome](https://img.shields.io/badge/PRs-welcome-brightgreen.svg)](https://github.com/kax168/awesome-free-ai-apis/pulls)\n[![Stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/kax168/awesome-free-ai-apis?style=social)](https://github.com/kax168/awesome-free-ai-apis)\n\n> A curated, up-to-date list of **genuinely free AI APIs** — no credit card, no trial expiry, no hidden fees. LLMs, image generation, speech, embeddings, and more.\n\n**Last verified: February 2026**\n\nBuilding AI apps shouldn't cost a fortune. This list helps developers, indie hackers, and students find **production-ready free AI APIs** across every category.\n\n⭐ Star this repo to stay updated — we verify limits monthly.\n\n---\n\n## Contents\n\n- [LLM APIs (Text Generation)](#llm-apis-text-generation)\n- [Image Generation](#image-generation)\n- [Speech & Audio](#speech--audio)\n- [Embeddings & Search](#embeddings--search)\n- [Multimodal](#multimodal)\n- [Code Generation](#code-generation)\n- [How to Choose](#how-to-choose)\n- [Contributing](#contributing)\n\n---\n\n## LLM APIs (Text Generation)\n\n### Tier 1: Truly Free — No Credit Card, No Expiry\n\n| Provider | Best Models | Rate Limit | Daily Quota | Card Required |\n|----------|------------|------------|-------------|---------------|\n| **[Google AI Studio](https://ai.google.dev/)** | Gemini 2.5 Pro, Flash | 5-15 RPM | 100-1000 req/day | ❌ No |\n| **[Groq](https://console.groq.com/)** | Llama 3.3 70B, Llama 4 Scout | 30-60 RPM | 1K-14K req/day | ❌ No |\n| **[OpenRouter](https://openrouter.ai/)** | DeepSeek R1, Llama 4, Qwen3 | 20 RPM | 50 req/day | ❌ No |\n| **[Mistral AI](https://console.mistral.ai/)** | Mistral Large, Codestral | 2 RPM | 1B tokens/month | ❌ No |\n| **[Cerebras](https://cloud.cerebras.ai/)** | Llama 3.3 70B, Qwen3 32B | 30 RPM | 1M tokens/day | ❌ No |\n| **[Cohere](https://dashboard.cohere.com/)** | Command R+, Embed 4 | 20 RPM | 1K req/month | ❌ No |\n| **[GitHub Models](https://github.com/marketplace/models)** | GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, o3 | 10-15 RPM | 50-150 req/day | ❌ No |\n| **[NVIDIA NIM](https://build.nvidia.com/)** | DeepSeek R1, Llama 4 | 40 RPM | 1K credits | ❌ No |\n| **[HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/inference-api)** | 300+ open models | Varies | Small monthly credits | ❌ No |\n| **[DeepSeek](https://platform.deepseek.com/)** | DeepSeek V3, R1 | No hard limit | 5M tokens free | ❌ No |\n| **[SambaNova](https://cloud.sambanova.ai/)** | Llama 3.3 70B, Qwen 2.5 | 10-30 RPM | $5 credits + free tier | ❌ No |\n| **[Cloudflare Workers AI](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/)** | Llama 3.2, Mistral 7B | N/A | 10K neurons/day | ❌ No |\n\n### Tier 2: Free Credits (Expire Eventually)\n\n| Provider | Best Models | Free Credits | Expiry | Card Required |\n|----------|------------|-------------|--------|---------------|\n| **[xAI](https://console.x.ai/)** | Grok 4, Grok 4.1 Fast | $25 signup | ~3 months | ❌ No |\n| **[AI21 Labs](https://studio.ai21.com/)** | Jamba Large, Mini | $10 credits | 3 months | ❌ No |\n| **[Fireworks AI](https://fireworks.ai/)** | Llama 3.1 405B, DeepSeek R1 | Limited free | Ongoing | ❌ No |\n| **[Together AI](https://api.together.xyz/)** | Llama 4, DeepSeek R1 | $5 signup | ~1 month | ⚠️ Yes |\n\n---\n\n## Image Generation\n\n| Provider | Models | Free Quota | Card Required |\n|----------|--------|-----------|---------------|\n| **[Google AI Studio](https://ai.google.dev/)** | Imagen 3, Gemini native | Included in free tier | ❌ No |\n| **[Cloudflare Workers AI](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/)** | FLUX.2, Stable Diffusion | 10K neurons/day | ❌ No |\n| **[HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/inference-api)** | FLUX, SDXL, community models | Small monthly credits | ❌ No |\n| **[Pollinations.ai](https://pollinations.ai/)** | FLUX, various open models | Unlimited (fair use) | ❌ No |\n| **[NVIDIA NIM](https://build.nvidia.com/)** | SDXL, ControlNet | 1K credits | ❌ No |\n\n---\n\n## Speech & Audio\n\n| Provider | Capabilities | Free Quota | Card Required |\n|----------|-------------|-----------|---------------|\n| **[Google AI Studio](https://ai.google.dev/)** | TTS, STT, audio understanding | Included in free tier | ❌ No |\n| **[ElevenLabs](https://elevenlabs.io/)** | TTS (30+ languages) | 10K chars/month | ❌ No |\n| **[Deepgram](https://deepgram.com/)** | STT, real-time transcription | $200 credits | ❌ No |\n| **[AssemblyAI](https://www.assemblyai.com/)** | STT, speaker diarization | 100 hrs free | ❌ No |\n| **[Cloudflare Workers AI](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/)** | Whisper STT | 10K neurons/day | ❌ No |\n\n---\n\n## Embeddings & Search\n\n| Provider | Models | Free Quota | Card Required |\n|----------|--------|-----------|---------------|\n| **[Cohere](https://dashboard.cohere.com/)** | Embed v4 (multilingual) | 1K req/month | ❌ No |\n| **[Google AI Studio](https://ai.google.dev/)** | text-embedding-004 | 1500 RPM | ❌ No |\n| **[Mistral AI](https://console.mistral.ai/)** | mistral-embed | 2 RPM | ❌ No |\n| **[HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/inference-api)** | BGE, E5, GTE, 100+ models | Small monthly credits | ❌ No |\n| **[Jina AI](https://jina.ai/)** | jina-embeddings-v3 | 1M tokens free | ❌ No |\n\n---\n\n## Multimodal\n\n| Provider | Capabilities | Free Quota | Card Required |\n|----------|-------------|-----------|---------------|\n| **[Google AI Studio](https://ai.google.dev/)** | Vision, audio, video, PDF | Included in free tier | ❌ No |\n| **[GitHub Models](https://github.com/marketplace/models)** | GPT-4o vision, Llama vision | 50-150 req/day | ❌ No |\n| **[OpenRouter](https://openrouter.ai/)** | Various vision models (free) | 50 req/day | ❌ No |\n| **[Groq](https://console.groq.com/)** | Llama 3.2 Vision 11B/90B | 30 RPM | ❌ No |\n\n---\n\n## Code Generation\n\n| Provider | Models | Free Quota | Card Required |\n|----------|--------|-----------|---------------|\n| **[Mistral AI](https://console.mistral.ai/)** | Codestral, Codestral Mamba | 2 RPM | ❌ No |\n| **[Google AI Studio](https://ai.google.dev/)** | Gemini 2.5 Pro (code) | 5 RPM | ❌ No |\n| **[GitHub Models](https://github.com/marketplace/models)** | GPT-4.1, o3 | 10-15 RPM | ❌ No |\n| **[Groq](https://console.groq.com/)** | Llama 3.3 70B, Qwen3 | 30 RPM | ❌ No |\n| **[DeepSeek](https://platform.deepseek.com/)** | DeepSeek Coder V3 | No hard limit | ❌ No |\n\n---\n\n## How to Choose\n\n**Building a prototype?** → Start with **Google AI Studio** (best models, most generous limits)\n\n**Need speed?** → **Groq** (300+ tokens/sec on custom LPU hardware)\n\n**Want model variety?** → **OpenRouter** (dozens of models, one API key)\n\n**Code-focused?** → **Mistral Codestral** or **DeepSeek Coder**\n\n**On a budget long-term?** → **DeepSeek** (cheapest paid rates when free runs out)\n\n**Edge/serverless?** → **Cloudflare Workers AI** (runs at the edge, no cold starts)\n\n**Enterprise RAG?** → **Cohere** (best embeddings + reranking combo)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start Examples\n\n### Google AI Studio (Python)\n\n```python\nimport google.generativeai as genai\n\ngenai.configure(api_key=\"YOUR_API_KEY\")\nmodel = genai.GenerativeModel(\"gemini-2.5-flash\")\nresponse = model.generate_content(\"Explain quantum computing\")\nprint(response.text)\n```\n\n### Groq (OpenAI-compatible)\n\n```python\nfrom openai import OpenAI\n\nclient = OpenAI(\n    base_url=\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\",\n    api_key=\"YOUR_GROQ_KEY\"\n)\nresponse = client.chat.completions.create(\n    model=\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\",\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello!\"}]\n)\nprint(response.choices[0].message.content)\n```\n\n### OpenRouter (cURL)\n\n```bash\ncurl https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"model\":\"deepseek/deepseek-r1:free\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Hello!\"}]}'\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Maximizing Free Tiers\n\n1. **Combine providers** — Use Google AI Studio for heavy lifting, Groq for speed-critical paths, OpenRouter for variety\n2. **Cache responses** — Same prompt = same answer. Cache aggressively to save quota\n3. **Use smaller models first** — Flash/8B models have higher free limits. Only escalate to Pro/70B when needed\n4. **Batch requests** — Send multiple items in one prompt instead of separate API calls\n5. **Monitor usage** — Most dashboards show remaining quota. Set up alerts before you hit limits\n\n---\n\n## Contributing\n\nFound a free API we missed? Limits changed? [Open a PR](https://github.com/kax168/awesome-free-ai-apis/pulls) or [create an issue](https://github.com/kax168/awesome-free-ai-apis/issues).\n\nPlease include:\n- Provider name and URL\n- Free tier details (limits, card requirement, expiry)\n- Date you verified the information\n\n---\n\n## Related Resources\n\n- [Free for Developers](https://github.com/ripienaar/free-for-dev) — Massive list of free SaaS/PaaS/IaaS\n- [Public APIs](https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis) — Collective list of free APIs\n- [Awesome LLM](https://github.com/Hannibal046/Awesome-LLM) — Curated LLM resources\n\n---\n\n## License\n\nMIT © [LaerKai](https://github.com/kax168)\n\n---\n\n**Made with ❤️ by [LaerKai](https://github.com/kax168)** — Follow for more developer resources!\n",
